{"id":"wb-1-167","name":"辽阳壁画墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"辽阳壁画墓群","text":"辽阳壁画墓群是东汉至魏晋时期的墓葬群。分布于今辽宁省辽阳市太子河两岸的棒台子、北园、三道壕、小青堆子、东台子、南台子等处。\n1961年辽阳壁画墓群被列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。此后2006年、2013年和2019年，又有7处辽阳市的汉魏墓葬被公布为全国重点文物保护单位，归入辽阳壁画墓群中。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BE%BD%E9%98%B3%E5%A3%81%E7%94%BB%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":93206627,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93206627","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f39611101aaa1101562d4b71.png","title":"Liaoyang_Han_Mural.png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Liaoyang_Han_Mural.png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/Liaoyang_Han_Mural.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Han Dynasty painters","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​中国辽宁省辽阳汉壁画墓夫妇对坐图","width":320,"height":241}}